<title>Ecuador's security crisis: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ecuador/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ecuador-2026-11-24T02:26:43.535Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 02:26:43 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;US forces have begun a land operation against cartels inside Ecuador while expanding military activities across Latin America. Former presidential candidate has denounced prison conditions at an appeal hearing and prison gangs are now sending bills to families of inmates. President Noboa asked the United States for $430.5 billion in security aid, met with Pete Hegseth on anti-narco cooperation, and rejected claims that former vice president Jorge Glas was tortured, saying his injuries were self-inflicted. Ecuadorian journalist Omar Toledo, who denounced local corruption, was shot by motorcycle gunmen. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxQRklvWklPTVl3ME52SnA0NF9YcmItc2xHeTRseGJydXJFUHo4c2NBcVZnRXlTYmRGVUlEdVlkNHVzUlgwM0NNaV9TcWNJTE5ZTlRkVUo4ZWpDY1Yxb25LU0JySndreUV4V3ZYejlUTnJsZDVqUzhMbk4xZUpjOGFoSUoxSUdiV3U0N2hjQU9abTdXOWx3d0xV?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNS0J3akM1b0FNdUdUam1iZm1TNzZ5dEswSFlLVUUyMXFmR0hDa2NZRk9sZHJzWUpDWmZYZ3M4a283MEd5WGhyMHZIWVFTZHl3czRydXVERFNZaUJ4MzNIXzM4dFNwUm1qVGdFQ3JyMVlmcnBKR2hfU1BQb1pJTDg2bzFmcVFTUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxQVWdQOGdXbngwYkYyenVmYXRRcGs2a1JHRDhqWGlsSVhXMU1qbFRZb2pwaFlHbnlKRlE2b2NKMGtEOVpES0d1WmhnSnFGRmRteFpGLTE4MHgyMW9FdXNjakF1eHp5dWs5UV9MRGJqVGFpNTgwZWFxeWxxQzBDa1NnQ0V3ZmdMZVFiZmlCcjVRcWx5aXpuQXhMX3o2MWZSR3N6aWJvdjVWOXA4cHhLZFFsZHJ5MU5tQVZ6eXR3a3pkMU1HQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTE1YdTJfSXliX3ZRSmNXaGxxSFpkeHFKaHpZcG5mWi00V0NFQ1FoNHFHR01xU2hXOFNtZmtUa2pacDJKVmNOLTIzSUxfVDRSMllVcXRaQ0hR0gFWQVVfeXFMTVh1Ml9JeWJfdlFKY1d